WEBVTT

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:08.540
The soccer team won yesterday, 
right? That's great!

00:00:08.540 --> 00:00:11.820
A foreign player came in to 
help and did amazing work!

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:13.960
It was really awesome!

00:00:17.220 --> 00:00:19.130
S-Serufu-san!

00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:20.190
Ow...

00:00:20.190 --> 00:00:23.340
Oh, Takumin. Morning.

00:02:22.870 --> 00:02:28.410
<b>Step 3
Does "DIY" Mean Why Did You Suddenly Show Up?</b>

00:02:31.260 --> 00:02:31.980
Morning.

00:02:32.430 --> 00:02:33.790
Good morning.

00:02:46.880 --> 00:02:47.760
Um...

00:02:49.500 --> 00:02:51.570
Do you need any help?

00:02:52.480 --> 00:02:53.730
Do you need any—

00:02:53.730 --> 00:02:55.590
Shuddap!

00:02:59.210 --> 00:03:01.380
Leave me alone!

00:03:05.790 --> 00:03:07.260
Apologies for keeping you waiting.

00:03:13.410 --> 00:03:14.570
What was that?

00:03:38.140 --> 00:03:40.220
Then I'll see you tomorrow!

00:03:39.260 --> 00:03:40.710
Bye-bye!

00:03:42.670 --> 00:03:44.810
An exchange student from America?

00:03:45.410 --> 00:03:48.160
Yes. In the class next to mine.

00:03:49.530 --> 00:03:54.190
I heard that she skipped grades to get 
to high school. She's a girl genius!

00:03:54.190 --> 00:03:56.400
They say she's still only twelve!

00:03:56.790 --> 00:03:58.790
I caught a glimpse of her,

00:03:59.130 --> 00:04:01.690
and she did seem like a very smart girl.

00:04:01.690 --> 00:04:03.010
Really?

00:04:03.440 --> 00:04:06.340
Well, it's got nothing to do with us anyway.

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:07.960
Serufu.

00:04:07.960 --> 00:04:09.830
I need your complete focus.

00:04:10.710 --> 00:04:11.700
Yes, ma'am!

00:04:11.990 --> 00:04:15.800
Are you listening? You have to 
bring your hammer straight down.

00:04:15.800 --> 00:04:18.650
And take advantage of 
the weight of the head.

00:04:18.930 --> 00:04:19.990
Right.

00:04:19.990 --> 00:04:22.500
Bring it straight down...

00:04:22.500 --> 00:04:25.160
Use the weight of the head...

00:04:25.530 --> 00:04:26.510
Okay.

00:04:27.450 --> 00:04:29.370
Straight...

00:04:34.120 --> 00:04:35.330
<b>Gatagata Girls' High School</b>

00:04:34.120 --> 00:04:35.330
<b>Yuyu Girl's Vocational High School</b>

00:04:40.850 --> 00:04:44.300
Space is really vast, isn't it?

00:04:44.660 --> 00:04:45.530
Yeah...

00:04:46.360 --> 00:04:47.430
What?

00:04:47.430 --> 00:04:49.690
I said to focus on what's in front of you.

00:04:50.440 --> 00:04:52.160
R-Right.

00:04:53.740 --> 00:04:54.320
Huh?

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:57.050
I didn't say anything.

00:05:08.540 --> 00:05:10.240
Blonde hair?

00:05:10.240 --> 00:05:11.390
Could that be...

00:05:11.920 --> 00:05:14.330
It's the girl genius from the rumors.

00:05:16.270 --> 00:05:17.530
Serufu-san?

00:05:23.750 --> 00:05:27.710
Hammer or handkerchief, 
which would you like?

00:05:27.710 --> 00:05:29.870
Oh my gosh...

00:05:32.210 --> 00:05:34.840
Yeah, a handkerchief makes sense.

00:05:35.220 --> 00:05:37.710
It's amazing how insensitive—

00:05:38.300 --> 00:05:40.530
—how she can just charge 
in without restraint.

00:05:40.940 --> 00:05:44.440
Yes. It isn't something 
I'd ever be able to do.

00:05:51.910 --> 00:05:54.880
S-So this isn't an abandoned shack?

00:05:55.600 --> 00:05:57.890
It's the club room for the DIY club.

00:05:57.890 --> 00:05:59.550
DIY club?

00:05:59.980 --> 00:06:02.950
DIY means "Do it—"

00:06:02.950 --> 00:06:04.910
Do it yourself.

00:06:04.910 --> 00:06:07.100
It's natural to know.

00:06:07.100 --> 00:06:09.890
Wow! You did that really well!

00:06:09.890 --> 00:06:12.480
D-Don't treat me like a child!

00:06:12.480 --> 00:06:14.010
Why were you crying?

00:06:15.630 --> 00:06:18.470
What? Where? Who?

00:06:18.470 --> 00:06:20.090
Did something happen?

00:06:20.090 --> 00:06:21.580
Outdated.

00:06:21.580 --> 00:06:22.390
Huh?

00:06:23.310 --> 00:06:25.390
DIY...

00:06:27.120 --> 00:06:31.330
It's just moldy, outdated, useless stuff.

00:06:32.780 --> 00:06:35.500
Purin said the same thing.

00:06:35.500 --> 00:06:36.620
Purin?

00:06:36.620 --> 00:06:39.980
Um, "Purin is Pudding!"

00:06:40.800 --> 00:06:44.440
Pudding said the same thing you did.

00:06:44.440 --> 00:06:47.100
Does Japanese pudding talk?

00:06:47.100 --> 00:06:49.090
None of that matters.

00:06:49.090 --> 00:06:52.550
What do you mean by saying DIY is useless?

00:06:53.450 --> 00:06:56.070
Doing things slowly by hand,

00:06:56.070 --> 00:06:59.510
in this age of mechanization, 
flies in the face of efficiency!

00:06:59.750 --> 00:07:00.860
It's nonsense!

00:07:00.860 --> 00:07:02.720
What did you just say?!

00:07:02.720 --> 00:07:04.120
Now, now...

00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:18.870
<b>Infirmary</b>

00:07:20.690 --> 00:07:23.090
There. You're all done.

00:07:23.950 --> 00:07:28.040
By the way, this is your second 
time today, isn't it, Serufu-san?

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:33.420
On top of which, you and our exchange 
student were injured together.

00:07:40.590 --> 00:07:42.050
Please have one.

00:07:48.650 --> 00:07:50.740
This is perfect!

00:07:50.740 --> 00:07:52.190
Good job!

00:07:52.480 --> 00:07:54.350
That sounded like a native speaker!

00:07:54.350 --> 00:07:56.110
Good job!

00:07:57.490 --> 00:08:00.800
If you really like it that 
much, I'll give you one.

00:08:03.870 --> 00:08:05.670
What does this say?

00:08:05.970 --> 00:08:08.130
It's sukonbu.

00:08:08.910 --> 00:08:10.770
Sukonbu...

00:08:11.730 --> 00:08:15.190
Sukonbu! Sukonbu! Sukonbu!

00:08:15.190 --> 00:08:17.010
Sukonbu! Su—

00:08:21.090 --> 00:08:22.340
W-Well...

00:08:22.740 --> 00:08:23.950
if you'll excuse me.

00:08:33.770 --> 00:08:36.360
And I hate DIY!

00:08:38.940 --> 00:08:40.840
What is with her?!

00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:43.790
<b>Sukon</b>

00:08:41.320 --> 00:08:43.790
She enrolled today, didn't she?

00:08:44.520 --> 00:08:47.240
And you're already friends?

00:08:47.240 --> 00:08:48.740
She was crying.

00:08:49.520 --> 00:08:51.080
Crying?

00:08:51.080 --> 00:08:53.450
I wonder if something happened.

00:08:53.990 --> 00:08:56.120
M-Maybe she was bullied?

00:08:56.120 --> 00:08:59.520
She doesn't have the kind of personality 
that would allow for bullying, though.

00:08:59.760 --> 00:09:02.320
Seriously, what does she mean, "outdated"?!

00:09:02.790 --> 00:09:05.970
If she feels that way, she 
should've gone to YuuVoc!

00:09:05.970 --> 00:09:10.830
That's true. They have cutting edge 
facilities and courses over there.

00:09:11.320 --> 00:09:15.940
Why did she go to the trouble of choosing 
to come to a normal girls' high school?

00:09:16.730 --> 00:09:18.770
It's quite the mystery.

00:09:19.170 --> 00:09:19.980
Yeah.

00:09:19.170 --> 00:09:20.550
It is.

00:10:12.350 --> 00:10:13.440
One, two!

00:10:13.440 --> 00:10:14.250
One, two!

00:10:14.250 --> 00:10:14.960
One, two!

00:10:14.960 --> 00:10:16.190
One, two!

00:10:15.210 --> 00:10:16.940
You're too fast! Wait up!

00:10:18.590 --> 00:10:19.590
Hurry up!

00:10:30.780 --> 00:10:31.620
Hup!

00:10:32.460 --> 00:10:33.800
Whoops.

00:10:34.590 --> 00:10:36.950
Straight down. Straight.

00:10:36.950 --> 00:10:37.910
Yes, ma'am!

00:10:37.910 --> 00:10:39.480
Don't hit your fingers.

00:10:39.480 --> 00:10:40.540
Focus.

00:10:40.890 --> 00:10:41.810
Hup!

00:10:42.610 --> 00:10:44.500
Oh dear...

00:10:44.500 --> 00:10:46.580
I said straight down.

00:10:46.960 --> 00:10:48.130
That's bad shit.

00:10:51.420 --> 00:10:54.030
Welcome! Did you come to hang out?

00:10:54.030 --> 00:10:57.010
N-No, I didn't come here to hang out.

00:10:57.670 --> 00:11:00.060
I only came to return this.

00:11:00.060 --> 00:11:02.420
I had it cleaned properly, too.

00:11:02.420 --> 00:11:04.640
Oh, you could've just left it as it was.

00:11:04.640 --> 00:11:06.310
But thanks!

00:11:06.650 --> 00:11:12.610
Man. Spending time in a place like 
this... I'll start growing mold, too.

00:11:13.280 --> 00:11:14.920
She left.

00:11:15.300 --> 00:11:16.820
Grrrrr...

00:11:18.010 --> 00:11:19.780
Thank you for the meal!

00:11:24.530 --> 00:11:27.620
This is yummy. Is it grilled beef tongue?

00:11:28.060 --> 00:11:29.580
It's pork tongue.

00:11:30.070 --> 00:11:32.050
So how is the DIY club?

00:11:32.550 --> 00:11:33.850
Is it fun?

00:11:33.850 --> 00:11:36.420
Yeah! We're trying to get more members,

00:11:36.420 --> 00:11:39.880
so we're doing all sorts of things 
to make the club room cuter.

00:11:39.880 --> 00:11:41.700
It's lots of fun!

00:11:42.170 --> 00:11:44.730
Just be careful not to injure yourself...

00:11:45.120 --> 00:11:47.280
more than the level than you already have.

00:11:47.730 --> 00:11:48.820
Of course!

00:11:54.860 --> 00:11:57.820
This pork tongue is delicious!

00:12:11.730 --> 00:12:14.120
"Fourth Industrial Revolution."

00:12:14.400 --> 00:12:18.040
When was that phrase first used?

00:12:18.040 --> 00:12:21.510
Yes, miss. You refer to the phrase about
 being with "the force," correct?

00:12:21.510 --> 00:12:25.760
That phrase was first used 
in 1977 in the movie—

00:12:25.330 --> 00:12:26.320
Not that!

00:12:28.990 --> 00:12:31.820
Then how about we do a 
surprise birthday party?

00:12:31.820 --> 00:12:33.390
Oh, I like that!

00:12:33.390 --> 00:12:35.310
Let's make the plans today after school!

00:12:48.660 --> 00:12:51.130
You really are incompetent.

00:12:53.370 --> 00:12:57.580
Seriously, what is with you?! 
You're here every single day!

00:12:57.840 --> 00:13:02.290
I'm just here to observe how much 
primitive humans are able to evolve.

00:13:02.870 --> 00:13:05.470
See? Look at this.

00:13:05.470 --> 00:13:07.140
A smartphone? What about it?

00:13:07.140 --> 00:13:09.690
I made this.

00:13:09.690 --> 00:13:10.930
Yeah?

00:13:10.020 --> 00:13:11.440
That's amazing!

00:13:11.440 --> 00:13:14.910
From design to build, I did it all!

00:13:14.910 --> 00:13:19.620
Computers, 3D printers, and 
automation machines...

00:13:19.870 --> 00:13:22.870
That is the cutting edge of 
this age and of humanity!

00:13:23.310 --> 00:13:27.740
Then you should've gone to Yuyu 
Girl's Vocational, shouldn't you?

00:13:27.740 --> 00:13:31.720
You could have studied that cutting-edge 
stuff as much as you wanted to, right?

00:13:32.780 --> 00:13:35.200
I-It's not like I—

00:13:35.200 --> 00:13:38.540
If all you're going to do is make 
fun of DIY, then don't come here!

00:13:41.580 --> 00:13:42.920
U-Um...

00:13:42.920 --> 00:13:44.330
Fine!

00:13:44.330 --> 00:13:47.330
Who'd want to come to this 
broken-down old shack anyway?!

00:13:47.600 --> 00:13:50.700
So there! You primitives!

00:13:49.680 --> 00:13:51.140
Oh! Wait!

00:13:54.160 --> 00:13:55.930
What is she, an elementary schooler?

00:13:56.270 --> 00:13:58.920
She is, in terms of age.

00:14:18.280 --> 00:14:20.040
Limousines...

00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:21.770
are really fast!

00:14:21.770 --> 00:14:23.570
You went after her, I see.

00:14:24.890 --> 00:14:27.400
Well, she'll probably come again tomorrow.

00:14:27.400 --> 00:14:30.090
When she does, we can 
follow up on this a little.

00:14:32.060 --> 00:14:33.000
All right.

00:14:33.010 --> 00:14:35.980
Club

00:14:46.100 --> 00:14:47.890
It doesn't seem like she's coming, does it?

00:14:47.890 --> 00:14:49.390
Yeah, she hasn't come.

00:14:47.890 --> 00:14:49.390
She's not coming, huh?

00:14:51.220 --> 00:14:55.130
She might have been lonely, don't you think?

00:14:55.460 --> 00:14:56.210
Huh?

00:14:56.600 --> 00:14:59.390
Twelve years old and living 
away from her parents...

00:14:59.390 --> 00:15:01.490
Studying abroad in a place 
she doesn't know...

00:15:02.400 --> 00:15:05.360
Everyone around being several years older...

00:15:06.360 --> 00:15:07.420
I'm sure...

00:15:11.440 --> 00:15:14.720
I'm sure she's having trouble 
fitting into her class.

00:15:15.100 --> 00:15:17.670
So, you're saying that's why she came here?

00:15:19.340 --> 00:15:23.070
She was lonely. That's why she was crying?

00:15:24.730 --> 00:15:27.470
Do you think she really 
 intends to stop coming?

00:15:28.190 --> 00:15:29.180
Hup!

00:15:30.220 --> 00:15:31.040
Huh?

00:15:31.040 --> 00:15:32.910
Then, let's go get her!

00:15:33.410 --> 00:15:36.220
Go get her? It's not that simple.

00:15:37.730 --> 00:15:38.650
No.

00:15:39.490 --> 00:15:42.110
Simple is good for this kind of stuff.

00:15:42.440 --> 00:15:43.250
Yes!

00:15:48.540 --> 00:15:49.130
Fwip!

00:15:49.130 --> 00:15:49.560
Fwip!

00:15:49.560 --> 00:15:50.170
Fwip!

00:15:50.610 --> 00:15:52.370
Sneak, sneak, sneak.

00:15:52.370 --> 00:15:53.280
Sneak, sneak...

00:15:56.580 --> 00:15:57.570
What?!

00:15:57.570 --> 00:15:59.000
Come on, let's go!

00:15:59.000 --> 00:16:00.400
Come with us!

00:16:00.400 --> 00:16:01.510
Where?!

00:16:01.510 --> 00:16:03.560
To the DIY club!

00:16:07.070 --> 00:16:08.680
Let's do it together!

00:16:08.680 --> 00:16:12.630
I'll teach you how to use 
an electric screwdriver!

00:16:12.630 --> 00:16:14.200
Why would I do that?

00:16:14.200 --> 00:16:16.650
How about we practice driving in screws?

00:16:17.010 --> 00:16:20.100
First you use a drill to make a hole.

00:16:20.100 --> 00:16:23.780
You hold it firmly, like this, 
and squeeze the trigger.

00:16:23.780 --> 00:16:25.910
Huh? Um...

00:16:26.160 --> 00:16:28.510
The bit is rotating in reverse.

00:16:28.510 --> 00:16:32.140
Oh, that's right! Right, right.

00:16:32.140 --> 00:16:34.530
So, you make a hole like...

00:16:34.530 --> 00:16:35.340
Huh?

00:16:35.510 --> 00:16:37.890
Adjust the clutch.

00:16:37.890 --> 00:16:38.850
Huh?

00:16:39.080 --> 00:16:42.870
Oh, honestly! You don't have 
enough torque! Give it!

00:16:43.140 --> 00:16:44.380
You do this...

00:16:53.410 --> 00:16:54.270
like this!

00:16:56.980 --> 00:16:58.910
That's all there is to it.

00:16:59.580 --> 00:17:02.970
It's pretty good for an entry-level model.

00:17:05.580 --> 00:17:06.750
Wow.

00:17:10.100 --> 00:17:12.130
D-DIY is just...

00:17:12.370 --> 00:17:13.940
You like it, don't you?

00:17:16.660 --> 00:17:18.110
Is that right?

00:17:36.880 --> 00:17:39.000
I did it, Mom!

00:17:39.690 --> 00:17:41.240
Good job!

00:17:44.980 --> 00:17:46.420
Mom...

00:17:49.370 --> 00:17:51.580
Would you prefer a hammer?

00:17:54.680 --> 00:17:57.050
That's not funny.

00:18:03.810 --> 00:18:05.990
How long will you be studying here?

00:18:08.120 --> 00:18:09.930
For the first term.

00:18:11.060 --> 00:18:14.910
Just while you're here,
 do you want to join?

00:18:15.260 --> 00:18:16.160
Huh?

00:18:16.480 --> 00:18:18.160
The DIY club.

00:18:18.160 --> 00:18:19.870
Do it with us!

00:18:19.870 --> 00:18:21.670
Okay? Come on!

00:18:21.670 --> 00:18:22.820
Club leader!

00:18:28.410 --> 00:18:30.180
If you don't want to, that's fine.

00:18:31.440 --> 00:18:34.120
I suppose I could join, as a favor to you...

00:18:34.570 --> 00:18:35.580
What was that?

00:18:37.190 --> 00:18:39.800
I suppose I could join, as a favor to you!

00:18:40.180 --> 00:18:42.060
Just can't be honest about 
your feelings, can you?

00:18:45.430 --> 00:18:46.910
In that case, here.

00:18:48.430 --> 00:18:49.900
Write your name.

00:18:50.170 --> 00:18:53.090
Oh, right! What's your name?

00:18:53.090 --> 00:18:54.240
I'm...

00:18:54.240 --> 00:18:55.860
Oh, wait!

00:18:55.860 --> 00:18:57.270
Let me guess!

00:18:57.270 --> 00:19:02.360
Let's see... Lincoln, Kennedy, Obama...

00:19:02.360 --> 00:19:05.920
You're just saying the names of American 
presidents that you know, aren't you?

00:19:06.160 --> 00:19:09.100
Juliet Queen Elizabeth VIII.

00:19:09.100 --> 00:19:10.190
It's so long!

00:19:10.190 --> 00:19:12.260
What a lovely name!

00:19:12.930 --> 00:19:14.630
I don't like it.

00:19:15.230 --> 00:19:16.030
Huh?

00:19:16.510 --> 00:19:18.250
Nothing.

00:19:18.250 --> 00:19:20.810
It's so long, I can't write it on here.

00:19:21.210 --> 00:19:22.950
You could use a different moniker.

00:19:22.950 --> 00:19:24.140
Moniker?

00:19:24.500 --> 00:19:26.310
She means a nickname.

00:19:26.310 --> 00:19:27.220
Nickname?

00:19:27.220 --> 00:19:28.510
I'll give you one!

00:19:28.690 --> 00:19:33.370
Let's see. Since you're Juliet 
Queen Elizabeth VIII-chan...

00:19:33.370 --> 00:19:34.680
It's amazing you can remember that.

00:19:35.180 --> 00:19:38.820
A shorter version would be Ju...Qu...

00:19:39.570 --> 00:19:41.280
Good job!

00:19:41.950 --> 00:19:43.420
Jobko-chan!

00:19:43.660 --> 00:19:45.040
Jobko?

00:19:45.040 --> 00:19:47.560
From "good job"! Jobko-chan!

00:19:47.560 --> 00:19:49.840
S-Serufu-san...

00:19:49.840 --> 00:19:52.090
No matter how you look at it, that's too...

00:19:55.760 --> 00:19:57.240
She likes it?

00:19:57.240 --> 00:19:58.770
She likes it!

00:20:02.760 --> 00:20:06.720
<b>Yasaku Rei
Yua Serufu
Hikage Takumi
Jobko</b>

00:20:11.690 --> 00:20:14.190
<b>Yasaku Rei</b>

00:20:11.690 --> 00:20:14.190
<b>Yua Serufu</b>

00:20:11.690 --> 00:20:14.190
<b>Hikage Takumi</b>

00:20:11.690 --> 00:20:14.190
<b>Jobko</b>

00:20:14.800 --> 00:20:16.360
Jobko...

00:20:19.390 --> 00:20:23.210
Our membership continues to 
grow. Things are going well.

00:20:23.210 --> 00:20:25.340
You're at risk of being shut down?

00:20:25.340 --> 00:20:27.110
Then you should be grateful to me.

00:20:27.110 --> 00:20:28.510
What are you, an elementary schooler?

00:20:34.660 --> 00:20:37.480
That blonde girl is the one from before.

00:20:38.020 --> 00:20:43.050
What's this? It's rare for Gata Girl's 
to get a transfer student, meow!

00:20:43.620 --> 00:20:45.360
Right, Suridecchi?

00:20:45.810 --> 00:20:48.500
I told you to stop calling 
me that, didn't I...

00:20:48.500 --> 00:20:49.320
Kouki-san?

00:20:49.620 --> 00:20:53.120
"Kouki-san"? Stop treating me 
like we don't know each other.

00:20:53.120 --> 00:20:54.610
You can call me Shii.

00:20:55.040 --> 00:20:56.520
Well, we don't know each other, do we?

00:20:56.770 --> 00:20:58.000
Honestly.

00:21:00.440 --> 00:21:01.910
Hey, Jobko?

00:21:02.390 --> 00:21:05.230
Why'd you decide to come to Gata Girl's?

00:21:06.310 --> 00:21:08.720
I was wondering about that, too.

00:21:10.040 --> 00:21:11.200
Jobko-chan?

00:21:12.880 --> 00:21:14.060
...wrong.

00:21:14.860 --> 00:21:15.540
What?

00:21:16.030 --> 00:21:20.200
I was planning to go to the school with 
cutting-edge facilities and courses,

00:21:20.200 --> 00:21:23.520
to Yuyu Girl's Vocational High School.

00:21:23.520 --> 00:21:24.380
Then why...

00:21:24.650 --> 00:21:27.210
I got it wrong! The Japanese!

00:21:27.600 --> 00:21:29.300
She got it wrong?

00:21:29.300 --> 00:21:31.180
When her Japanese is so good?

00:21:31.180 --> 00:21:35.720
I'm still not good at reading and 
writing. That's how I got it wrong!

00:21:36.270 --> 00:21:40.410
When I was doing the paperwork, I got 
Gata Girl's and Yuu Girl's mixed up...

00:21:44.860 --> 00:21:47.070
<b>Yuu Girl's</b>

00:21:44.860 --> 00:21:47.070
<b>Gata Girl's</b>

00:21:45.200 --> 00:21:47.070
Don't laugh!

00:21:47.070 --> 00:21:48.980
But it's because of a mistake!

00:21:48.270 --> 00:21:52.100
Hey! Japanese is really hard!

00:21:48.980 --> 00:21:50.610
That's so cute.

00:21:50.610 --> 00:21:52.980
Things like that happen sometimes.

00:23:36.140 --> 00:23:40.010
<b>Step 4</b>

00:23:36.140 --> 00:23:40.010
<b>"DIY" Means You'll Find It Possible
 to Feel Comfortable Anywhere</b>
